{"id":"9d2a6862fd2083e6","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-godel-sentence-modal.md","title":"Consistency as the Explicit Gödel Fixed Point","display":"ex-godel-sentence-modal — Consistency as the Explicit Gödel Fixed Point","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-godel-sentence-modal","aliases":["89-ex-godel-sentence-modal"],"display":"ex-godel-sentence-modal — Consistency as the Explicit Gödel Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[89-df-godel-sentence-modal]]","[[89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point]]","[[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","[[89-lem-normal-replacement]]","[[89-lem-gl-normal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-godel-sentence-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-godel-sentence-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-godel-sentence-modal — Consistency as the Explicit Gödel Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8595a46bd83435a9\" href=\"?note=8595a46bd83435a9\" title=\"89-df-godel-sentence-modal\">89-df-godel-sentence-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc27d1abcea524e3\" href=\"?note=dc27d1abcea524e3\" title=\"89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point\">89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03089c3cefed4872\" href=\"?note=03089c3cefed4872\" title=\"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness\">89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2d3d18f0211ece52\" href=\"?note=2d3d18f0211ece52\" title=\"89-lem-normal-replacement\">89-lem-normal-replacement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ccac24cdfa254e90\" href=\"?note=ccac24cdfa254e90\" title=\"89-lem-gl-normal\">89-lem-gl-normal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\">\\(\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\\)</span> 为 Gödel 不动点类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\neg\\Box\\bot\\in\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\\;\n\\bigl((G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box G)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box\\bot)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\neg\\Box\\bot\\in\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\\;\n\\bigl((G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box G)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box\\bot)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 105、108–111；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\neg\\Box p\">\\(A=\\neg\\Box p\\)</span>，A-trace 第 0 行令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=0\">\\(p=0\\)</span>，此后令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=1\">\\(p=1\\)</span>；唯一盒列从第 1 行开始为 0。因此有界构造给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg R_0\">\\(\\neg R_0\\)</span>，它命题等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\bot\\)</span>。构造定理与正规替换给该代表确为不动点。任意成员的自不可证等价由定义；与代表的等价由不动点唯一性得到。\n这把原先只重述类定义的“例子”补为实际存在的见证和全部成员的分类。算术解释中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 表示一致性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 表示矛盾可证。它们不能互换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-godel-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"8595a46bd83435a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-sentence-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"03089c3cefed4872","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-replacement","status":"resolved","id":"2d3d18f0211ece52","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-replacement]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-normal","status":"resolved","id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\neg\\Box\\bot\\in\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p},\\\\\n&\\forall G\\in\\mathcal G_{\\Box,p}\\;\n\\bigl((G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box G)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box\\bot)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A=\\neg\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"p=0","display":false},{"tex":"p=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg R_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\bot","display":false}],"bytes":1579,"backlinks":[{"id":"8595a46bd83435a9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"下标 $\\Box$ 指本书的 GL 模态语言，真正可变的字母参数是 $p$。旧记号仅在已固定同一个 $p$ 时使用，不把不同的排除字母条件混成一个无参数类。成员 $G$ 不含 $p$，且 $(G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box G)\\in\\mathrm{GL}$。由于 $\\neg\\Box p$ 关于 $p$ 模态化，弱条件与原书加强不动点条件等价；本类允许其他字母，不额外声称所有成员在语法上无字母。\n在算术实现下，所得等价是句子与其不可证断言之间的 PA 可证等价。它不是元层不可证性，也不是公式语法相等。存在性与代表元见 [[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"例子与边界：[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase]]、[[89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum]]、[[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]、[[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。练习展开：[[89-lem-fixed-point-valuation]]、[[89-thm-double-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["8595a46bd83435a9","dc27d1abcea524e3","03089c3cefed4872","2d3d18f0211ece52","ccac24cdfa254e90"]}